{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t天文台表示，香港經歷自1884年以來最暖的10月，️上個月平均最高氣溫30.5度、平均氣溫27.6度，及平均最低氣溫25.8度，全部打破歷來10月的最高紀錄。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n天文台說，除了受氣候暖化影響，亦由於處於極強的厄爾尼諾事件，加上上月東北季候風較正常弱，而影響華南的高空反氣旋則較正常強，這些都是導致今次最暖10月的原因。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.858815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T07:47:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:58:33.953809+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:10.609093+00:00","content_hash":"9aba5c09daed7cfebd15bf1855786c247c8ca4eca6c46ce1a08ea4a9cdd0fbab","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}